    The Turnstile challenge for a form (FR-AUTH-14, FR-WORD-05).

    Configured: the Cloudflare widget, which fills `cf-turnstile-response`.
    Not configured — possible in development and test only, because the
    configuration refuses to boot staging or production without the keys — a
    placeholder token, so the form is usable locally. The unconfigured verifier
    checks presence only and never claims the token was verified. %>
<% if (locals.turnstileSiteKey) { %>
  <div class="cf-turnstile" data-sitekey="<%= locals.turnstileSiteKey %>"></div>
<% } else { %>
  <input type="hidden" name="cf-turnstile-response" value="turnstile-not-configured">
<% } %>
